"On the evening of 29 October 1923 Mustafa Kemal was elected the first President by the unanimous vote of the 158 deputies present.",
"3 March 1924: Education Under One Roof","Grand National Assembly","On 3 March 1924 the Assembly passed three important laws on the same day.","The Caliphate was abolished; the Ottoman dynasty was sent abroad.",
"With the Law on the Unification of Education, all schools were brought under one roof, the Ministry of Education.","The Ministry of Religious Law and Foundations was abolished; the Presidency of Religious Affairs was set up in its place.",
"On 20 April of the same year the new constitution was adopted.","A great step towards a unified education and a secular state.","Tevhid-i Tedrisat means 'unification of education': medreses, schools and foreign schools were joined in one education system.",
